   "pin": null,
   "question": "",
   "quote": "In builds without the wallet, -signer is only registered by DummyWalletInit as a plain hidden option, so it doesn't get NEGATE_TO_EMPTY, but the node still reads it, for example in the enumeratesigners RPC, so -nosigner still runs the command 0 there.",
